  "description": "Broke and hungry, Park Taeho never expected a random delivery of potatoes to lead him to the quiet village of Hongwol-ri, where he is forced into a farming showdown with his wealthy enemy, Hyeon Seungju. Tilling fields by day and sharing a roof by night, their chaotic rural life is filled with non-stop bickering. But as physical closeness breeds emotional sparks, Taeho realizes his biggest challenge isn't farming, it's resisting his rival.\n\n(Source: Lezhin Entertainment)",
